   >> The little dog was sad because| he wanted to eat the treat all by himself. He did not want to share with the other dog. The other dog was sad too and hungry. The little dog felt bad for not sharing. / The dog tried to be kind and share with the other dog. They ate together and were happy. The other animals did not want to be friends anymore. In the end, the dog learned that sharing is good and being selfish is not nice. The little dog and the other animals played and had fun together.
